  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Three of my avatars loose particle effects when loaded in build 884, requiring a reupload to restore the effects\n\nAvatar 1\navtr_48d23336-ed33-456c-8ec6-13accaa3fa34\nEffect can be performed by Emote->Ligtning_ENABLE, then using the finger gun gesture\n\nA lightning bolt should appear where you aimed (provided the target is in range), but is missing on 2018\n\nAvatar 2\navtr_54d00b7f-dd51-404c-81a2-13244cec693a\nEffect can be performed using the victory emote\n\nEffect is a recreation of the Nutter or whooper puke, should cover surrounding area on impact, missing on 2018\n\nAvatar 3\navtr_7a52c7a4-7840-4de5-b67b-cb8c8e281ab4\nEffect can be performed using both the thumbs up & finger gun gestures.\n\nAnimation uses a full screen static effect, the effect is created using 2 pairs of mesh particle emitters\n\nThe 1st pair (which play multiple times when charging) work correctly, the last effect (played just before/during firing) fails to render.",
